      "writtenOn": "2020-01-30T22:52:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003d NOT_CHARGING with 0 current is OK\n\u003d DISCHARGING with current \u003e 0 is a failure.\n\u003d DISCHARGING with 0 average current is not a failure unless the condition persists over time\n\nDISCHARGING with 0 current is possible right after disconnect when you compare state to average . It is possible (but unlikely) to have DISCHARGING with 0 instantaneous current since \"instantaneous\" is usually averaged over a (very short) period of time.\n\nNOTE: reporting NOT_CHARGING while disconnected is a failure",
      "revId": "98a3e115fadb627b2a4e65883d1a50df480baad9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
